    "result": "Re-inspected v1.18.25 at the unchanged audited commit. The CLI emits complete text-part snapshots only after an end time, not provider deltas; the processor accumulates deltas before completion, and the typed schema carries session, message, and part identity. Distinct completed parts require boundaries even within one assistant message; repeated identities are snapshots, not append-only fragments. The session API supports JSON-schema output through StructuredOutput, but run --format json does not request it. Model-catalog, inline-permission, and custom-tool contracts remain unchanged. Fixtures are synthetic source-contract evidence, not a live-provider capture.",
